{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>נהפך עלי למשחית</b> — a noun or an adjective. And R. Moses said: for its parallel is הר המשחית, but in my opinion it is a verb like אָשְׁתּוֹלְלוּ אַבִּירֵי לֵב, said concerning Zion," "<b>ולהיות משחית</b> — from the root of שמן המשחה. And it is a trembling adjective, and its parallel is משמים בתוכה. Now if this new month is the first, it is Nisan; now from the first of the month he began to fast, and we do not know the truth. [n: 'trembling adjective' translates מרעיד תואר, which is grammatically obscure; rendered hyper-literally.]" "The Gaon [Saadia] said: the meaning of עומד לנגדי — that he was teaching him, and he forgot שניהם יעמדו נגדו, and the meaning is not מאיש עומד לנגדי, for so he thought; therefore he asked: הלנו אתה אם לצרינו. And he said: the meaning of להלחם עם מלך פרס is to help him, and its parallel is: התלך אתי למלחמה, for אתי is like עמי. But this is not correct, for וילחם עם ישראל and also ונלחמה אותם במישור — all are the opposite. And this that he cited: התלך אתי למלחמה — אתי is not attached to מלחמה but only to the going. And furthermore: if he were helping him, how is it written והנה יוצא והנה שר יון בא, who destroyed the king of Persia — when this angel was helping him? And I will explain all this further." "<b>וטעם אחד השרים הראשונים</b> — like: היושבים ראשונה במלכות; therefore he is called השר הגדול. And were it not for this, I would say ומלכי פרס, meaning שרי פרס — they are the officers who stand over Persia, just as Michael stands over Israel." "<b>וטעם באחרית הימים</b> — for now he will recount in prophecy all that will happen until the coming of the Messiah, when all the kingdoms of the earth will perish, as he has explained and will further explain."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:20:58.049215372Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}